<title>SPAIN: Spain's Repsol adjusts final 1996 results.</title>
<headline>Spain's Repsol adjusts final 1996 results.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Final full 1996 results for</p>
<p>Repsol group in billions of pesetas, unless stated:</p>
<p> Operating revenues		   2,771.76  vs  2,544.78</p>
<p> Operating profit			 198.61  vs    212.50</p>
<p> Financial results			 (8.67) vs    (16.57)</p>
<p> Extraordinary items		     (1.71) vs     (7.04)</p>
<p> Profit before tax and minorities   188.23  vs    188.90</p>
<p> Taxes					(55.20) vs    (60.56)</p>
<p> Profit before minorities	     133.03  vs    128.33</p>
<p> Minorities				 (13.81) vs    (10.62)</p>
<p> Net attributable profit		119.22  vs    117.72</p>
<p> Cash flow after tax		    259.26  vs    245.20</p>
<p> Earnings per share (pesetas)	 397.41  vs    392.38</p>
<p> Cash flow per share (pesetas)	864.20  vs    817.34</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures are non-audited results to be approved by the shareholders' meeting on June 6, adjusted from the provisional figures released on January 29.</p>
<p>By business division, operating results were adjusted as follows (figures in billions of pesetas):</p>
<p> Exploration and production	    31.58  up  66.2 pct</p>
<p> Refining and marketing		  81.32  up   7.0 pct</p>
<p> Chemicals				   24.07  vs   n.a.</p>
<p> Gas					   62.63  up   8.8 pct</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
